  (text "BOM lists a TPS2117 power mux for this domain; it has no KiCad library symbol, so a BAT54C diode-OR is drawn instead (about 0.3 V drop, VDD_TAMPER 2.7-3.0 V)."
    (at 15.24 328.93 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "769dcd7e-621d-44c4-abfc-a87a83976c1a")
  )
  (text "The STM32U5 VBAT pin takes VBAT_CELL directly, so TAMP backup registers (which hold S) survive even if VDD_TAMPER collapses. MAIN_PG reads low when main power is absent."
    (at 15.24 332.74 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "0f9f1e55-11ae-4c8f-81b8-a44c6cabdfef")
  )
)
